@API_HostAddress = http://localhost:5000
@Product_API = {{API_HostAddress}}/api/products
@Variants_API = {{API_HostAddress}}/api/variants

### =====================================================================
### 1. SEED DATA: Crear Producto Base con 2 Variantes Iniciales (ID = 1)
### =====================================================================
# @name createProduct
POST {{Product_API}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Teclado Mecánico RGB",
  "description": "Teclado con switches red y retroiluminación RGB",
  "categoryId": null,
  "subcategoryId": null,
  "brandId": null,
  "isActive": true,
  "variants": [
    {
      "sku": "KEY-RGB-BLK",
      "priceArs": 85500.00,
      "comparisonPriceArs": 95000.00,
      "discountArs": 9500,
      "stock": 15,
      "size": "Standard 100%",
      "color": "Negro",
      "hexColor": "#000000"
    },
    {
      "sku": "KEY-RGB-WHT",
      "priceArs": 88000.00,
      "comparisonPriceArs": null,
      "discountArs": 0,
      "stock": 10,
      "size": "Standard 100%",
      "color": "Blanco",
      "hexColor": "#FFFFFF"
    }
  ]
}

### =====================================================================
### 2. VARIANT GET ENDPOINTS
### =====================================================================

### 2.1 Obtener todas las variantes
GET {{Variants_API}}

### 2.2 Obtener variante por ID (Variante ID = 1)
GET {{Variants_API}}/1

### 2.3 Obtener variante por ID (Variante ID = 2)
GET {{Variants_API}}/4


### =====================================================================
### 3. VARIANT POST / PUT / DELETE ENDPOINTS
### =====================================================================

### 3.1 Agregar una nueva variante al Producto ID = 1 (Variante ID = 3)
POST {{Product_API}}/1/variants
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "sku": "KEY-RGB-PINK",
  "priceArs": 92000.00,
  "comparisonPriceArs": 100000.00,
  "discountArs": 8000,
  "stock": 5,
  "size": "Standard 100%",
  "color": "Rosa",
  "hexColor": "#FFC0CB"
}

### 3.2 Actualizar una variante existente (Variante ID = 1 del Producto ID = 1)
PUT {{Product_API}}/1/variants/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "sku": "KEY-RGB-BLK-V2",
  "priceArs": 89000.00,
  "comparisonPriceArs": 98000.00,
  "discountArs": 9000,
  "stock": 20,
  "size": "Standard 100%",
  "color": "Negro Mateo",
  "hexColor": "#1A1A1A"
}

### 3.3 Eliminar variante por ID (Variante ID = 2)
DELETE {{Variants_API}}/2